14|/* So does the focus, for the controls you click repeatedly — pressing + three
15|   times should not mean finding the button again each time.
16|
17|   Asked for per save, never remembered: a control that merely HAD focus once
18|   must not get it back on an unrelated redraw. It did, briefly, and clicking +
19|   would hand focus to whichever search box you had last touched — which then
20|   popped its typeahead list open. */
21|let focusKey = null;
